      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS AUSTRALIANA (1) is rolling through her grades now and made it four wins on the trot when scoring at this circuit and distance on Tuesday. Faces a stronger line-up but the ace draw gives her the chance to take another step up. JANIE BLU (2) has had seven weeks off since she worked but dug deep for a win at this circuit and distance. Kept up to the mark with a trial and is well served by this draw. ROCKNROLL COWBOY (12) has kept his manners in check and performed well in his last two outings, coming from a similar barrier to score last week. May need some luck but his strike rate here now stands at 50 per cent. ULTIMATE CRUZA (5) enjoys a class drop off the Breeders Challenge and won over this distance the last time he raced in this grade. FASTING (4) wasn't too far away here on Tuesday and draws well so may be competitive.",
